{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:27:44.011Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"785d86c7a59d401d3bb2a1d1e54ddb71e25cdbdc5d251eb8ee2c5eb490df69e7","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"@Ruth Calloway, here is what Moss's digests show. They use \"Gideon's\" and \"Nadia's\" shorthand rather than formal owner fields, so treat the owners as a reading of the digests, and check the CRM before the board slide.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato (inferred). Moss's 5/4 digest says Nadia's industrial account was reassigned in the CRM effective 5/4, and the 8/3 and 9/30 digests describe Gideon's biggest account as Vantorre Group.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he assumed management of it that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. Moss's 9/30 and 12/1 digests call it \"Gideon's medical account.\"\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** No digest names an owner. Nadia Fennimore appears to be working it (she volunteered for the 2 Oct gate-clerk training and raised the Bozeman Dock Door 4 change), but that is an inference.\n\n**Vantorre Group change of hands:** 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 prep note said it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04,\" and the 5/4 digest confirms the reassignment took effect that day.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
