{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:27:46.466Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"cd10e09649285db5d7ed3c0e8a1896e8a0287a3735117f33a677f49432ad19a8","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, I posted the answer in #strategic-pod as a reply to your message. Moss's digests use \"Gideon's\" and \"Nadia's\" shorthand rather than formal owner fields, so check the CRM before the board slide.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato (inferred from the digests).\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** No digest names an owner. Nadia Fennimore appears to be working it, but that is an inference.\n- **Vantorre Group change of hands:** 2026-05-04. The 5/3 prep note said it changes hands the next day, and the 5/4 digest confirms the reassignment took effect that day."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
